<title>USA: TIG Holding president, COO Hutson to retire.</title>
<headline>TIG Holding president, COO Hutson to retire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TIG Holdings Inc said on Thursday that Don Hutson, its president and chief operating officer, will retire by the end of 1997.</p>
<p>Jon Rotenstreich, the chairman and chief executive, will serve as acting president and COO until Hutson's successor is named.</p>
<p>Hutson, 60, will continue with TIG as a consultant after he retires.</p>
<p>TIG is the holding company for a property/casualty insurance group.</p>
